INSTALLATION
============

1. (Optional) The default Makefile should work on a POSIX-compliant system, 
   but it can be edited to choose a specific compiler or compiler flags.

2. Issue the following commands to build and test ipcmd:

    make [CC=...] [CFLAGS=...]

USAGE
=====

[mpiexec] mpififo [-crv] writefifo1 readfifo1 [writefifo2 readfifo2...]
  -c : create fifos upon startup
  -r : remove fifos after mpififo exits
  -v : verbose output to stderr (for debugging)

See the web site and publication for more information.

WEB SITE
